data/runs/

# Solo-gate workdirs are scratch: the store holds the evidence blobs.
runs/solo*/

# Pausing the research is a fact about one machine at one moment, not a
# research parameter, so it stays out of the history. It also must not live
# under runs/, which every pass stages and commits: the first version did, and
# a pass deleted its own stop signal and ran for eight hours on a paused
# machine.
.crucible-paused
